#: ../pwntools/docs/source/intro.rst:13
msgid ""
"When writing exploits, pwntools generally follows the \"kitchen sink\" "
"approach."
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/intro.rst:17
msgid ""
"This imports a lot of functionality into the global namespace.  You can "
"now assemble, disassemble, pack, unpack, and many other things with a "
"single function."
msgstr ""

