msgid "Setting the Target Architecture and OS"
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/intro.rst:124
msgid ""
"The target architecture can generally be specified as an argument to the "
"routine that requires it."
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/intro.rst:131
msgid ""
"However, it can also be set once in the global ``context``.  The "
"operating system, word size, and endianness can also be set here."
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/intro.rst:138
msgid "Additionally, you can use a shorthand to set all of the values at once."
msgstr ""

