msgid "Assembly and Disassembly"
msgstr ""

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/intro.rst:170
msgid ""
"Never again will you need to run some already-assembled pile of shellcode"
" from the internet!  The :mod:`pwnlib.asm` module is full of awesome."
msgstr ""

